<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        body { font-family: sans-serif; background-color: #0a0a0a; color: #ffffff; padding: 20px; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: #1a1a1a; padding: 40px; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid #333; }
        .logo { color: #f97316; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; font-style: italic; }
        .button { background-color: #f97316; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; display: inline-block; margin-top: 20px; }
        .footer { margin-top: 30px; font-size: 12px; color: #666; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="logo">Censura</div>
        <h1>Welcome to the Front Row! 🎬</h1>
        <p>Hi there,</p>
        <p>Thanks for subscribing to our newsletter. You'll be the first to know about:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Top Rated Movies of the week</li>
            <li>Exclusive Editor's Picks</li>
            <li>New Premium Series arrivals</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="<%= website_url %>" class="button">Explore Now</a>
        <div class="footer">
            If you didn't sign up for this, you can safely ignore this email.
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>